    "result_text": "Only one test class exists (`AcceptanceTest`), and the full suite is green.\n\nDone. The change adds a welcome notification on successful owner creation:\n\n- **New function** `EnqueueWelcomeNotification.java` \u2014 reads the saved `Owner` via `@Val` and emits a line through a logger named `NOTIFY` containing both the owner id and the memberId.\n- **Wired into** `owners.POST.yml` as a new `enqueueWelcome` step between `audit` and `respond`, under the same `transaction` governance. It only runs on the create path \u2014 the idempotency replay branch (`respondReplay`) bypasses it, so no notification is re-sent on replays.\n\nThe acceptance test `coreEnqueuesWelcome` (which captures the `NOTIFY` logger and asserts a line contains the owner id and memberId) passes, and `BUILD SUCCESS` with 0 failures.",
